					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				


								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >🪓 CHOP TREES</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Click a tree and swing. Trunks split, logs scatter across the grass, and a lucky hit lands a BONUS that showers the ground in timber. Upgrade your cursor axe through five tiers and watch each level land with a heavier, flashier impact.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/32ace9b023d89ca8bd180b921efee025.poster.avif?t=1791824552" width=560 height=314 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/32ace9b023d89ca8bd180b921efee025.mp4?t=1791824552" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >🏡 RAISE A VILLAGE</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Wood becomes homes, homes become people. Your settlement grows behind its palisade — houses, lumberjack huts, sawmills, quarries, forges and towers — each one filled with a worker you can actually watch doing their job.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/cd937921251f17ecf40da378f10275d4.poster.avif?t=1791824552" width=560 height=314 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/cd937921251f17ecf40da378f10275d4.mp4?t=1791824552" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >🔨 BUILD AND UPGRADE</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Open the build menu, drop a foundation on the grid, and watch your builders haul the materials in and raise it plank by plank. Then upgrade it: every tier costs the resource of its age, so your village visibly changes shape as you climb.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/28cc6811d62e34fe219c070c280f6e1a.poster.avif?t=1791824552" width=560 height=314 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/28cc6811d62e34fe219c070c280f6e1a.mp4?t=1791824552" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >⭐ UNLOCK 50+ TALENTS</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Earn Renown as you play and spend it on a branching talent tree with four paths — Axe &amp; Felling, Village &amp; Automation, Economy &amp; Resources, and Masters &amp; Magic. Build a one-hit feller, a hands-off automated village, or a gold engine that pays for everything.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/30a02adfe79beaa78c7f2706aae47dcf.poster.avif?t=1791824552" width=560 height=314 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/30a02adfe79beaa78c7f2706aae47dcf.mp4?t=1791824552" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >🗿 ADVANCE THROUGH FIVE AGES</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Primitive, Wood, Stone, Iron, Medieval. Each age asks for a checklist — stockpiles, key buildings, a strong wall — and when it's complete, TOTEM TIME arrives. Raise the totem and the whole village transforms in front of you: straw to timber, timber to stone, stone to medieval keeps.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/72924e71503463ccb69a38df96a9e93b.poster.avif?t=1791824552" width=560 height=314 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/72924e71503463ccb69a38df96a9e93b.mp4?t=1791824552" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >🥷 WATCH THE TREELINE</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >The forest brings guests, and not all of them knock. A thief slips out of the trees and heads straight for your stores — catch him and he vanishes in a puff of smoke. Merchants set up stalls, treasure hunters dig up chests, and nobles ride in to inspect what you've built.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/131bb081044bed26bf1e9313eaa62a91.poster.avif?t=1791824552" width=560 height=314 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/131bb081044bed26bf1e9313eaa62a91.mp4?t=1791824552" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >🔮 PUT MASTERS TO WORK</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >The wizard walks the entire forest inside a ring of magic, growing trees back out of nothing and buffing every villager he passes. The bard leaves the tavern and lifts the output of everyone in range. These aren't decoration — they change your numbers while you watch.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/1ad94f421387f453aff39de6d89ec401.poster.avif?t=1791824552" width=540 height=304 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/1ad94f421387f453aff39de6d89ec401.mp4?t=1791824552" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >👑 ALL HAIL THE KING</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Finish the last age and the palace goes up. The royal court walks in, confetti falls over the treetops, and the village you cut out of an empty forest gets its crown.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/a263cb5e3d74813ee1c1d8c705cf9bb4.poster.avif?t=1791824552" width=560 height=314 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042740/extras/a263cb5e3d74813ee1c1d8c705cf9bb4.mp4?t=1791824552" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p>						</div>
					</div>
