					Some of the game's content was created with the assistance of generative AI tools and was then reviewed, edited and curated by the developer. This includes portions of the art assets, some audio content, and the translation of interface and subtitle text into languages other than Turkish and English. No content is generated by AI at runtime.				</i>
			</p>
